{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18697","headline":"巽公院五咏 曲讲堂 · 柳宗元","name":"巽公院五咏 曲讲堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂灭本非断，文字安可离。\n曲堂何爲设，高士方在斯。\n圣默寄言宣，分别乃无知。\n趣中即空假，名相与谁期。\n愿言绝闻得，忘意聊思惟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18697.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18697","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}